  },
  {
   "id": "a03-text-11",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 166,
   "width": 937,
   "height": 48,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 87109,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1152019,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "First, no LFA: A fails the loop-free check, 2 < 1 + 1 = 2 is false (A2). So look further\naway.",
   "originalText": "First, no LFA: A fails the loop-free check, 2 < 1 + 1 = 2 is false (A2). So look further\naway.",
   "fontSize": 19,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a03-text-12",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 224,
   "width": 634,
   "height": 120,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 95028,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1256748,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Set               Test (strict <)                        Example 2\n----------------  -------------------------------------  ---------\nP-space of S      dist(S,Y) < c(S,E) + dist(E,Y)         {A, B}\nExtended (via A)  dist(A,Y) < dist(A,S) + dist(S,Y)      adds C\nQ-space of E      dist(Y,E) < dist(Y,S) + c(S,E)         {B, C}\nPQ nodes          extended P ∩ Q                         {B, C}",
   "originalText": "Set               Test (strict <)                        Example 2\n----------------  -------------------------------------  ---------\nP-space of S      dist(S,Y) < c(S,E) + dist(E,Y)         {A, B}\nExtended (via A)  dist(A,Y) < dist(A,S) + dist(S,Y)      adds C\nQ-space of E      dist(Y,E) < dist(Y,S) + c(S,E)         {B, C}\nPQ nodes          extended P ∩ Q                         {B, C}",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a03-text-13",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 354,
   "width": 118,
   "height": 24,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 102947,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1361477,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The numbers",
   "originalText": "The numbers",
   "fontSize": 19,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a03-text-14",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 388,
   "width": 778,
   "height": 120,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 110866,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1466206,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Y   P(S): dist(S,Y) < 1 + dist(E,Y)     Q(E): dist(Y,E) < dist(Y,S) + 1\nA   1 < 1 + 2 = 3   ✓                    2 < 1 + 1 = 2   ✗ (tie)\nB   2 < 1 + 2 = 3   ✓                    2 < 2 + 1 = 3   ✓\nC   2 < 1 + 1 = 2   ✗ (tie)              1 < 2 + 1 = 3   ✓\n\nExtended via A:  dist(A,C) = 2 (A → B → C) < dist(A,S) + dist(S,C) = 1 + 2 = 3  ✓",
   "originalText": "Y   P(S): dist(S,Y) < 1 + dist(E,Y)     Q(E): dist(Y,E) < dist(Y,S) + 1\nA   1 < 1 + 2 = 3   ✓                    2 < 1 + 1 = 2   ✗ (tie)\nB   2 < 1 + 2 = 3   ✓                    2 < 2 + 1 = 3   ✓\nC   2 < 1 + 1 = 2   ✗ (tie)              1 < 2 + 1 = 3   ✓\n\nExtended via A:  dist(A,C) = 2 (A → B → C) < dist(A,S) + dist(S,C) = 1 + 2 = 3  ✓",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a03-text-15",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 518,
   "width": 596,
   "height": 24,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 118785,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1570935,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Which PQ node? (B11: lowest cost from S, then lowest id)",
   "originalText": "Which PQ node? (B11: lowest cost from S, then lowest id)",
   "fontSize": 19,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a03-text-16",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 552,
   "width": 519,
   "height": 40,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 126704,
