   "locked": false,
   "text": "Same ring, but B–C costs 10, so no shortest path\nuses it.",
   "originalText": "Same ring, but B–C costs 10, so no shortest path\nuses it.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a03-text-49",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 18,
   "y": 1193,
   "width": 270,
   "height": 94,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 388031,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 5131721,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "P(S) = {A, B}   ext via A: C?\n  dist(A,C) = 3 < 1 + 2 = 3  ✗\nQ(E): B  3 < 2 + 1 = 3  ✗\n      C  1 < 2 + 1 = 3  ✓\nP ∩ Q = {A,B} ∩ {C} = { }",
   "originalText": "P(S) = {A, B}   ext via A: C?\n  dist(A,C) = 3 < 1 + 2 = 3  ✗\nQ(E): B  3 < 2 + 1 = 3  ✗\n      C  1 < 2 + 1 = 3  ✓\nP ∩ Q = {A,B} ∩ {C} = { }",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a03-text-50",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 18,
   "y": 1297,
   "width": 496,
   "height": 43,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 395950,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 5236450,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "No PQ node: Remote LFA fails. TI-LFA crosses the gap\nwith an Adj-SID (A5).",
   "originalText": "No PQ node: Remote LFA fails. TI-LFA crosses the gap\nwith an Adj-SID (A5).",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a03-rectangle-51",
   "type": "rectangle",
   "x": 553,
   "y": 804,
   "width": 533,
   "height": 554,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
   "backgroundColor": "#ebfbee",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": {
    "type": 3
   },
   "seed": 403869,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 5341179,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false
  },
  {
   "id": "a03-text-52",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 571,
   "y": 822,
   "width": 358,
   "height": 28,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 411788,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 5445908,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Which way the tunnel leaves S",
   "originalText": "Which way the tunnel leaves S",
   "fontSize": 22,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a03-text-53",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 571,
   "y": 860,
   "width": 496,
   "height": 43,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 419707,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 5550637,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "•  PQ node in plain P(S): the tunnel follows S’s own\n   shortest path. It already avoids S–E.",
   "originalText": "•  PQ node in plain P(S): the tunnel follows S’s own\n   shortest path. It already avoids S–E.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a03-text-54",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 571,
   "y": 913,
   "width": 496,
   "height": 43,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 427626,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 5655366,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "•  PQ node only in some P(N): the tunnel must go out\n   through N. S’s own path to it may use S–E.",
   "originalText": "•  PQ node only in some P(N): the tunnel must go out\n   through N. S’s own path to it may use S–E.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a03-text-55",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 571,
   "y": 966,
   "width": 365,
   "height": 40,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 435545,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 5760095,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Example 2:  B → S’s own path S → A → B\n            C → exit via A",
   "originalText": "Example 2:  B → S’s own path S → A → B\n            C → exit via A",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a03-text-56",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 571,
   "y": 1016,
   "width": 477,
   "height": 64,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 443464,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 5864824,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Why C needs the exit: S’s own path to C is S → E →\nC, over the failed link. A’s path A → B → C avoids\nit.",
   "originalText": "Why C needs the exit: S’s own path to C is S → E →\nC, over the failed link. A’s path A → B → C avoids\nit.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a03-text-57",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 571,
   "y": 1090,
   "width": 448,
   "height": 43,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 451383,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 5969553,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Several exits? Lowest c(S,N) + dist(N,PQ), then\nlowest router id.",
   "originalText": "Several exits? Lowest c(S,N) + dist(N,PQ), then\nlowest router id.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a03-text-58",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 571,
   "y": 1143,
   "width": 466,
   "height": 40,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 459302,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 6074282,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "A neighbor with max metric 16,777,215 on its link is\nnever an exit (RFC 7490 §5.4).",
   "originalText": "A neighbor with max metric 16,777,215 on its link is\nnever an exit (RFC 7490 §5.4).",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a03-rectangle-59",
   "type": "rectangle",
   "x": 1107,
   "y": 804,
   "width": 533,
   "height": 554,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#7048e8",
   "backgroundColor": "#f3f0ff",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": {
    "type": 3
   },
   "seed": 467221,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 6179011,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false
  },
  {
   "id": "a03-text-60",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1125,
   "y": 822,
   "width": 358,
   "height": 28,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#7048e8",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 475140,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 6283740,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Q-space looks towards E (B10)",
   "originalText": "Q-space looks towards E (B10)",
   "fontSize": 22,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a03-text-61",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1125,
   "y": 860,
   "width": 457,
   "height": 43,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 483059,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 6388469,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "P-space uses dist(S,Y): from S outwards. Q-space\nuses dist(Y,E): from each router towards E.",
   "originalText": "P-space uses dist(S,Y): from S outwards. Q-space\nuses dist(Y,E): from each router towards E.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a03-text-62",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1125,
   "y": 913,
   "width": 457,
   "height": 43,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 490978,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 6493198,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "With different metrics each way these differ, so\nQ-space needs a reverse SPF rooted at E (A1).",
   "originalText": "With different metrics each way these differ, so\nQ-space needs a reverse SPF rooted at E (A1).",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a03-text-63",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1125,
   "y": 966,
   "width": 477,
   "height": 64,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 498897,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 6597927,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Q-space aims for E, not D: once at E, the packet\nfollows E’s path to D. So one PQ node serves every\ndestination behind E (RFC 7490 §5.2.1.3).",
   "originalText": "Q-space aims for E, not D: once at E, the packet\nfollows E’s path to D. So one PQ node serves every\ndestination behind E (RFC 7490 §5.2.1.3).",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a03-text-64",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1125,
   "y": 1040,
   "width": 493,
   "height": 40,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 506816,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 6702656,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "RFC 7490 writes dist(S,E); it equals c(S,E) when S–E is\na primary link (D17).",
   "originalText": "RFC 7490 writes dist(S,E); it equals c(S,E) when S–E is\na primary link (D17).",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
