   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "S can’t pass its own tests, and E is never listed:\nif E were in some P(N), N would already be an LFA\n(D17).",
   "originalText": "S can’t pass its own tests, and E is never listed:\nif E were in some P(N), N would already be an LFA\n(D17).",
