   "versionNonce": 10577629,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "P-space = routers S reaches without the failed link; Q-space = routers that reach E without it. A router in both (a PQ node) is a safe place to tunnel to. Remote LFA\nfixes most rings, but fails when P-space and Q-space don’t meet.",
   "originalText": "P-space = routers S reaches without the failed link; Q-space = routers that reach E without it. A router in both (a PQ node) is a safe place to tunnel to. Remote LFA\nfixes most rings, but fails when P-space and Q-space don’t meet.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
